w ways to STEAL & LOOT!\n🔒 Unlock new HOUSES, STORES, BANKS & WORLDS by purchasing new BLUEPRINTS!\n📈 Try to get to the top of the LEADERBOARDS!\n\nMade by Funwise.","path":"/game/8232438881-thief-simulator","slug":"8232438881-thief-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/55b2a26ffb06788e196ab5ac43de1780f45d31b5f43f62ef80ecf2373cf04574.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8b54844623fd8aef4bf41fee4503a628/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":10,"visitor":72766952,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-29T19:41:47.209Z","creator":{"name":"Funwise","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":3121370344,"name":"Pears to Pairs Card Game","desc":"Welcome to Pears to Pairs, a simple, fun, and hilarious tabletop card game! 🍐\n\nThe rules for the game are simple. Each player is given a random set of cards that are objects/phrases. At the start of each round, a judge is selected along with a random card, an adjective. Your goal? Select a card that you think the judge will pair with their card to win! 🏆\n\nWith 1500+ different game cards and various game modes, you are sure to come up with crazy card combinations and have endless hours of fun! At least 3 players in a server are needed to play. 🎮\n\nWith full device cross compatibility, you can play the game on the go on your phone or tablet. Your cards and win stats also save between all devices and servers. Private servers are free to rent to play specifically with your friends! 📱","path":"/game/3121370344-pears-to-pairs-card-game","slug":"3121370344-pears-to-pairs-card-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/670f05a162e25ce6b02e7314e00c756e974c20557ef0f7ef0e03922c3fafe4ae.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cc739c12af60ddd876131b2e693ab96a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":10,"visitor":32274690,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-09-23T03:08:28.249Z","creator":{"name":"Pears to Pairs Development","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7603178367,"name":"[UPD] Chipotle Burrito Builder","desc":"Welcome to Chipotle Burrito Builder. Teleport back to the original Chipotle location in 1993, the year the Chipotle burrito was born. Use your skills to build and roll burritos like a true Chipotle crew member.\n\n🚨UPDATE🚨\nOpen CARD PACKS to unlock rewards, open all 53 for a free ENTREE or UGC Avatar Item from Chipotle!\n🎟️ENTER the Cinema!\n📷WATCH our NEW FILM!\n\nThe chance of receiving any card is equal.\nBurrito Bucks available in the Chipotle Burrito Builder experience have no monetary value and do not constitute currency or property of any type.\n\nAd","path":"/game/7603178367-chipotle-burrito-builder","slug":"7603178367-chipotle-burrito-builder","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/87417f43373ae5fb10bb61ee1c9b5de20867369ede1ce264ead85cea477ec7d4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6ba1d493e9a1a1cd91e14db6f31ffca0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":10,"visitor":38223459,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-15T21:23:59.130Z","creator":{"name":"Chipotle","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":2636441885,"name":"Speed City","desc":"Speed City","path":"/game/2636441885-speed-city","slug":"2636441885-speed-city","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5e333e32d5d2f9c621e5815104465da44dc12854ccb77e26386a45e7dc44cf63.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-30fcff3e391bad3fbff9b538c704e9fc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":10,"visitor":334344229,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-06-16T03:08:46.980Z","creator":{"name":"Speed City","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":2116002761,"name":"Afton's Family Diner","desc":"Yes, this is a roleplay.\nCredits: \n-LoneWatermelon: Lead Developer, Coder, Builder, Animator, Importer, UI Art \n-Lamorn: Lead Music Composer \n-Eclipsed_Vision: Lead Animator \n-PopularCant: UI Art, Bui